<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">[</span><span style="color:#032F62;text-decoration:underline">Relative link</span><span style="color:#24292E">](</span><span style="color:#24292E;text-decoration:underline">/docs/getting-started</span><span style="color:#24292E">)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">[</span><span style="color:#032F62;text-decoration:underline">Link to section</span><span style="color:#24292E">](</span><span style="color:#24292E;text-decoration:underline">#headings</span><span style="color:#24292E">)</span></span>
<span class="line"></span></code></pre>
<p><strong>Result:</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://example.com">Link text</a>
<a href="https://example.com" title="Link title">Link with title</a></p>
<p><a href="/docs/getting-started">Relative link</a>
